silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_03_sections_01_concrete_anchor_3#classfeliscatus silm:hasLongDescription "The ClassFelisCatus is Felis catus (the stage-2 refinement). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Class^{(2)}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
